{
  "summary": "This experiment tested an RNA-only multiprofile setup using scvi_n200 encoder and avgpool aggregation, achieving validation accuracy of 0.6501 and F1 of 0.6275. The results suggest RNA-only multiprofile configurations may offer performance benefits over unimodal baselines, but the specific contribution of aggregation or profile-level features remains uncertain without further comparisons to multimodal setups."
}

